**********************************************************************
*                                                                    *
*                                                                    *
*      REAL TIME UPDATE SUBROUTINE                                   *J
*                                                                    *
*                                                                    *
**********************************************************************

* FUNCTION   IS IS THE PURPOSE OF THIS SUBROUTINE TO PROVIDE A MEANS
*            TO ACCUMULATE ELAPSED TIME FOR THE LVDC PREPARE TO LAUNCH
*            ROUTINE. IF ENTRY IS FROM ANY OTHER ROUTINE, NO TIME WILL
*            BE ACCUMULATED.

* ENTRY      PRUS     ENTER TO UPDATE REAL TIME

       ORG     FBR1,D.DATA
PRUS   STO     777          SAVE RETURN HOP CONSTANT
*                           FIXME: IN PREPARE TO LAUNCH?
*                           FIXME: UPDATE DELTA TIME ACCUMULATION
       HOP     777
